{"root":{"data":{"id":"dk50w7jmve00","created":1784715642613,"text":"历史选择性必修一"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk50ydwp1kw0","created":1784715813190,"text":"第一单元 政治制度"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk51mdm9tsw0","created":1784717693300,"text":"第1课 中国古代政治制度的形成与发展"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk5uplqbj6o0","created":1784799758239,"text":"先秦时期的政治制度"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk6qz1dasww0","created":1784890773075,"text":"夏、商、西周是中国古代奴隶制国家政治制度的形成与发展时期。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qzaiemjk0","created":1784890792974,"text":"夏"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk6qzgh98800","created":1784890805966,"text":"约公元前 2070 年，禹建立了我国最早的奴隶制王朝国家夏。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qznvba4o0","created":1784890822053,"text":"禹死后，其子启继位，打破了原始民主制下的禅让政治传统，世袭制代替了禅让制。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qzveo2lc0","created":1784890838461,"text":"商"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk6r01vpm740","created":1784890852552,"text":"商朝建立后，实行内外服制，商王直接控制内服王畿地区，王畿四周是外服。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6r0ct4gu00","created":1784890876340,"text":"据记载，商朝已经有较系统的国家机构和分掌内外服各类事务的官吏。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk6r0s7pi5s0","created":1784890909874,"text":"西周"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk6r0x9s6fc0","created":1784890920883,"text":"西周时期，天子是国家最高统治者，控制着镐京和洛邑附近的王畿地区，其他地方则分封给与周天子有血缘关系的同姓贵族、异姓功臣或旧贵族，在各地建立诸侯国。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6r24m41j40","created":1784891015230,"text":"分封制与宗法制","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk6r18r9qyg0","created":1784890945885,"text":"诸侯在国内又分封卿大夫，卿大夫再分封士，形成贵族等级分封序列。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6r1e2tge80","created":1784890957467,"text":"按照宗法制，周天子与各级贵族都实行嫡长子继承制。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6r1jkmb5c0","created":1784890969428,"text":"分封制是较内外服制更进一步的政治制度，诸侯虽享有受封土地上的统治权，但要服从周天子的政令，承担对周王室的义务。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6r1w99r2w0","created":1784890997040,"text":"分封制与宗法制相配合，政治权力分配与血缘关系相结合，是西周政体的基本特征。"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk5uprkus3k0","created":1784799770969,"text":"秦朝的政治制度"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk7i6p8xza80","created":1784967543571,"text":"秦的统一结束了长期战争的混乱局面，在全国范围内建立起中央集权的政治制度。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk7i6yb9iio0","created":1784967563302,"text":"皇帝制度是秦朝政治制度的核心，“天下之事无小大皆决于上”，丞相和诸大臣听命于皇帝，一切政治、军事、法律事务的决定权都在皇帝手中。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk7i7eo52qo0","created":1784967598909,"text":"官僚机构"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk7ji8lum3s0","created":1784971268826,"text":"秦朝在中央建立了以公卿为首的一套官僚机构。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk7jic9y07s0","created":1784971276813,"text":"皇帝之下设三公九卿。"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk7jijz6kj40","created":1784971293576,"text":"三公指丞相、太尉、御史大夫。"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk7jiqf7ia00","created":1784971307606,"text":"丞相是百官之长，分左、右，秉承皇帝旨意，统领众官，丞相府是行政中枢所在"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk7jj0c59bk0","created":1784971329189,"text":"太尉是最高武官，掌军事"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk7jj51b36o0","created":1784971339417,"text":"御史大夫是副丞相，协理国政，掌管图籍、文书，同时又是最高监察官"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk7jjf3xfhk0","created":1784971361344,"text":"三公之下是分掌国家各种政务和皇室事务的卿，泛称“九卿”。"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk7jjmkf1ds0","created":1784971377578,"text":"九卿下设若干部门，处理具体事务。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk7jjqf8uu80","created":1784971385972,"text":"三公九卿共同组成中央政府，国家重大事务往往由公卿进行廷议，最后由皇帝裁断。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk7jqocugeo0","created":1784971930023,"text":"郡县制"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk7jqtt6di80","created":1784971941894,"text":"在总结春秋战国以来“天下共苦战斗不休”历史教训的基础上，秦始皇在全国推行郡县制。"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk7jr2mm5280","created":1784971961089,"text":"秦朝地方行政机构分为郡、县两级","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk7jsly07qw0","created":1784972081500,"text":"郡","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk7jrs0kjds0","created":1784972016352,"text":"郡是地方最高行政机构，置郡守、郡丞和郡尉，另设监御史掌监察。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk7jrxuqhwo0","created":1784972029060,"text":"秦统一后设 36 郡，后又不断调整。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk7jspg3cl40","created":1784972089124,"text":"县","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk7js5jix4o0","created":1784972045796,"text":"郡下设县或道，根据户数的多少，置县令（长）、县丞、县尉。郡县主要官吏都由中央直接任命。"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk7mbo1e4880","created":1784979217198,"text":"文书"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk7mbsj93q00","created":1784979226985,"text":"在秦朝统一的中央集权国家治理中，文书发挥着重要作用，各级官僚机构以文书推行行政管理。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk7mbysdsj40","created":1784979240597,"text":"秦朝还建立了以邮传为中心的文书传送系统，以保障皇帝和中央的政令能够传送到全国各地。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk7mccjpl2w0","created":1784979270548,"text":"文献与出土材料均反映秦朝文书十分繁密。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk7mchmkmc80","created":1784979281605,"text":"秦始皇日夜批阅大量文书，不达到一定的数量“不得休息”。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk5upw1yd9s0","created":1784799780710,"text":"两汉至明清时期政治制度的演变"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk7mh1jz8f40","created":1784979638440,"text":"汉"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk7mh8gx4hk0","created":1784979653493,"text":"汉承秦制，中央行政制度仍为三公九卿制。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk7mhditlb40","created":1784979664492,"text":"汉武帝为了加强集权，设立中朝，中央行政中枢的权力逐渐由丞相转移到皇帝亲信手中，从而使外朝丞相的权力大大削弱。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkfa5vh1awo0","created":1785757389531,"text":"西汉晚期，中朝尚书的权力逐渐增大。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkfa5ys08xc0","created":1785757396724,"text":"至东汉，刘秀将尚书台确立为新的行政中枢，三公权力受到削弱。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dkfa65x1v7s0","created":1785757412267,"text":"隋唐"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkfaidkzzhc0","created":1785758369322,"text":"三省六部制"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkfaikc4j200","created":1785758384023,"text":"标志着中央行政制度发展到一个新阶段。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkfair1oojk0","created":1785758398629,"text":"三省"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkfaiu81m2g0","created":1785758405544,"text":"中书省"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkfajorbj0o0","created":1785758472013,"text":"受命于皇帝的决策机构"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dkfaj9bsjf40","created":1785758438423,"text":"门下省"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkfajs5426w0","created":1785758479378,"text":"审议封驳朝廷政令的机构"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dkfajbaomtc0","created":1785758442709,"text":"尚书省"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkfajuio6p40","created":1785758484551,"text":"执行机构"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkfawbs9nlc0","created":1785759462506,"text":"六部"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkfawdtens80","created":1785759466929,"text":"吏"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkfawebiyhs0","created":1785759468025,"text":"户"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkfaweogupk0","created":1785759468807,"text":"礼"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkfawf0nf2g0","created":1785759469544,"text":"兵"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkfawfyarew0","created":1785759471578,"text":"刑"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkfawgwr3kw0","created":1785759473662,"text":"工"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkfb1dw8tts0","created":1785759858921,"text":"分工处理各项具体政务"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dkfajgylurk0","created":1785758455040,"text":"是由皇帝直接掌控的中枢"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkfak9vbcnc0","created":1785758517967,"text":"宰相"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkfakcbtx9k0","created":1785758523319,"text":"长官中书令"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkfakee8lds0","created":1785758527819,"text":"门下侍中"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkfakgfeohs0","created":1785758532243,"text":"尚书令"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkfakiepxgg0","created":1785758536555,"text":"尚书仆射"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkfaw1ad34g0","created":1785759439656,"text":"（议政的地方叫政事堂）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkhrfd831bs0","created":1786009212231,"text":"宋朝最高行政长官是同中书门下平章事，为宰相之职。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dkhrfu6hlow0","created":1786009249139,"text":"枢密院"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkhrg5zyyxc0","created":1786009274867,"text":"掌管军政"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dkhrfxfbvv40","created":1786009256204,"text":"三司"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkhrg0yyq800","created":1786009263922,"text":"掌握财政大权"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dkfb1x4j4jc0","created":1785759900781,"text":"三省六部制体系完整，职责分明，相互制约，可以有效履行封建国家的不同职能。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dkhrgi86fq80","created":1786009301484,"text":"宋"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dkhrfd831bs0","created":1786009212231,"text":"宋朝最高行政长官是同中书门下平章事，为宰相之职。"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk51me1tb8g0","created":1784717694240,"text":"第2课 西方国家古代和近代政治制度的演变"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk5uq5pk40w0","created":1784799801728,"text":"古希腊罗马的政治制度"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk5uqbqrprc0","created":1784799814862,"text":"中古西欧的封建制度"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk5uqigyfds0","created":1784799829506,"text":"西方资本主义政治制度的产生与发展"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk51med9igg0","created":1784717694932,"text":"第3课 中国近代至当代政治制度的演变"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk5uqvrfy080","created":1784799858439,"text":"民国时期的政治制度"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk5ur514l9k0","created":1784799878615,"text":"中国共产党在根据地和解放区的制度探索"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk5ur9el9og0","created":1784799888137,"text":"中华人民共和国的政治制度"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk51mej3cx40","created":1784717695286,"text":"第4课 中国历代变法和改革"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk5urfm8jpk0","created":1784799901660,"text":"中国古代的重要变法和改革"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk5urivzxug0","created":1784799908780,"text":"中国近代的改革探索"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk5urmaqmls0","created":1784799916202,"text":"新中国成立以来的重要改革"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk50yf056bk0","created":1784715815576,"text":"第二单元 官员的选拔与管理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk529ee82yo0","created":1784719497366,"text":"第5课 中国古代官员的选拔与管理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk5v0d8zcg80","created":1784800601783,"text":"秦汉至魏晋南北朝时期的官员选拔与管理"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk5v0h2lxfs0","created":1784800610104,"text":"隋唐至两宋时期的官员选拔与管理"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk5v0kjtl6g0","created":1784800617675,"text":"元明清时期的官员选拔与管理"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk529mkdlw00","created":1784719515152,"text":"第6课 西方的文官制度"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk5v0p9qui80","created":1784800627950,"text":"西方文官制度出现的背景"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk5v0u9kc1k0","created":1784800638823,"text":"西方文官制度的建立"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk5v0xejeao0","created":1784800645654,"text":"西方文官制度的特点和影响"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk529x5rqko0","created":1784719538214,"text":"第7课 近代以来中国的官员选拔与管理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk5v40l9ao80","created":1784800887683,"text":"晚清选官制度的变革"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk5v44026o80","created":1784800895108,"text":"民国时期的官员选拔制度"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk5v47yxtso0","created":1784800903748,"text":"中华人民共和国的干部制度和公务员制度"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk50yfv86ag0","created":1784715817455,"text":"第三单元 法律与教化"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk52a9zexlk0","created":1784719566127,"text":"第8课 中国古代的法治与教化"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk6qhq6ptq80","created":1784889416541,"text":"先秦时期的德治与法治"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qhvdchjs0","created":1784889427826,"text":"秦汉至隋唐时期的法律与教化"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qhyboyhs0","created":1784889434256,"text":"宋元至明清时期的法律与教化"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk52ahrjvbc0","created":1784719583066,"text":"第9课 近代西方的法律与教化"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk6qi1p8ykg0","created":1784889441606,"text":"近代西方法律制度的渊源及发展"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qi53x0rk0","created":1784889449024,"text":"近代西方法律制度的基本特征"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qi8cxxog0","created":1784889456100,"text":"宗教伦理与教化"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk52apchirc0","created":1784719599570,"text":"第10课 当代中国的法治与精神文明建设"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk6qica9xbc0","created":1784889464646,"text":"新中国的法治建设进程"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qih60po00","created":1784889475272,"text":"社会主义精神文明建设"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk52b2vdb800","created":1784719629010,"text":"第四单元 民族关系与国家关系"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk52bc5d0kw0","created":1784719649205,"text":"第11课 中国古代的民族关系与对外交往"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk6qiueyz6o0","created":1784889504112,"text":"秦汉时期的民族关系"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qix7xtk00","created":1784889510217,"text":"隋唐至两宋时期的民族关系"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qizg4wxs0","created":1784889515066,"text":"元明清时期的民族关系"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qj3d92600","created":1784889523599,"text":"中国古代的对外交往"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk52bjttbvs0","created":1784719665921,"text":"第12课 近代西方民族国家与国际法的发展"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk6qj7qn6jc0","created":1784889533115,"text":"近代西方民族国家的产生"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qja8gjx40","created":1784889538546,"text":"国际法的形成与外交制度的建立"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qjdda1yw0","created":1784889545368,"text":"20 世纪国际法的发展"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk52c26bsrc0","created":1784719705860,"text":"第13课 当代中国的民族政策"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk6qji1e4m00","created":1784889555533,"text":"民族区域自治制度的建立"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qjljtfww0","created":1784889563178,"text":"民族区域自治制度的发展"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qjp2lcvs0","created":1784889570843,"text":"中共十八大以来民族区域自治制度的完善"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk52caoc5zk0","created":1784719724363,"text":"第14课 当代中国的外交"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk6qjsc2bs00","created":1784889577946,"text":"开创独立自主的和平外交"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qjw7v8g80","created":1784889586400,"text":"改革开放后的外交成就"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qjz8n35c0","created":1784889592977,"text":"中共十八大以来的中国特色大国外交"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk52cfx6i5s0","created":1784719735781,"text":"第五单元 货币与赋税制度"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk52cvr0n940","created":1784719770237,"text":"第15课 货币的使用与世界货币体系的形成"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk6qmqa5zn40","created":1784889808571,"text":"中国货币的演进历程"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qmxbm5sw0","created":1784889823896,"text":"世界货币体系的形成"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk52cw1t41k0","created":1784719770890,"text":"第16课 中国赋税制度的演变"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk6qn0o1vu00","created":1784889831178,"text":"中国古代的赋役制度"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qn3ni9tk0","created":1784889837675,"text":"关税与个人所得税制度的起源与演变"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk52cmdxob40","created":1784719749855,"text":"第六单元 基层治理与社会保障"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk52cwkxxfs0","created":1784719772047,"text":"第17课 中国古代的户籍制度与社会治理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk6qn7gv9mo0","created":1784889845981,"text":"历代户籍制度演变"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qnaex2nk0","created":1784889852394,"text":"历代基层组织与社会治理"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qngpaum80","created":1784889866082,"text":"历代社会救济与优抚政策"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk52cwwwee80","created":1784719772770,"text":"第18课 世界主要国家的基层治理与社会保障"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dk6qnm0v5tc0","created":1784889877665,"text":"西方主要国家基层治理的历史与特点"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dk6qnpfi0f40","created":1784889885080,"text":"现代社会保障制度的建立与发展"},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"snow","version":"1.4.43"}